  number  = {52},
  pages   = {e2514202122},
  year    = {2025},
  doi     = {10.1073/pnas.2514202122},
}
% notes: Primary work showing that multiple neuromodulatory systems fluctuate in synchrony during NREM sleep. Cited by the Nir-lab review for exactly the claim that the infra-slow organization extends beyond noradrenaline; use alongside kjaerby2026neuromodulators.
